oming up and want to fill it, so which of my tasks is roughly an hour of work?\", \"Also, I need to look someone up and I can never remember which one is which, could you pull up Flennir for me?\", \"Hang on, before I forget, I've been meaning to check this — where do I stand with Camille Oliveira in petanque crew at the moment?\", \"Right, going back to those two from before — I actually gave the Kenduwick one a ring earlier, so could you log that call?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0049\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you… yeah, can you tick off my jasmine task? it's done\"], [\"I finally got round to sorting the plants out on the windowsill this morning, so could you mark my jasmine task as done please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0051\", \"v\": [[\"delete the tugboat event\", \"no, wrong one — the Ramona one\", \"docs linked to Byblos Fields?\"], [\"can u get rid of the tugboat event\", \"no wait wrong one, i meant the Ramona one\", \"diff thing, what documents have i got linked to Byblos Fields\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0052\", \"v\": [[\"lampshade picture → Walks round Café Zoby album\", \"text Luca happy birthday\"], [\"I was going through my pictures and realised one didn't get sorted, so could you add the lampshade picture to the Walks round Café Zoby album?\", \"Oh and it's just occurred to me I nearly forgot again this year, can you send Luca a message saying happy birthday from me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0053\", \"v\": [[\"I grabbed a coffee with Luca Crennard earlier — would you mind logging that for me, please?\"], [\"We bumped into each other near the station and ended up chatting for ages, so I had a coffee with Luca Crennard — can you log that so I keep track?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0055\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please delete the climbing wall note?\", \"Thank you. Separately, could you tell me which documents I have linked to Lymere Rise?\"], [\"umm can you delete the… the climbing wall note, yeah that one\", \"ok and, uh, what documents have I got that are linked to Lymere Rise?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0056\", \"v\": [[\"ok so can you, um, delete the crumpet note for me?\", \"oh and uh… is there anything in the password… in my locker that mentions wifi? no wait — wifi in the locker, anything?\"], [\"pls delete the crumpet note\", \"also which things in my locker mention wifi\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0057\", \"v\": [[\"note: the plumber prefers texts\", \"add Zoby pic to Coral progress album\"], [\"can u jot down a note that says the plumber prefers texts\", \"oh and add the Zoby pic to my Coral progress album pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0058\", \"v\": [[\"which task is like a twenty minute job\", \"diff thing, remind me to buy a new artichoke monday\"], [\"Could you tell me which of my tasks is roughly a twenty minute job?\", \"On another matter, would you please remind me to buy a new artichoke on monday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0059\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please move both of the crystal things — the task and the calendar entry — to next monday?\", \"Thank you. Also, could you tell me which colander tasks I haven't done yet?\"], [\"move both crystal things to next monday, the task n the calendar one\", \"which colander tasks havent i done yet\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w19-0060\", \"v\": [[\"I'm getting my paperwork together before I sit down with the accountant, so can you show me what documents are in the Taxes folder?\", \"Great, and what about the Petanque folder — what's sitting in there?\", \"Different question, I keep forgetting who's coming along — who am I seeing at the crystal?\", \"And one more thing while I'm planning my week, could you pull up my balcony events from the calendar?\"], [\"whats in the Taxes folder\", \"and Petanque?\", \"who am i seeing at the crystal\", \"also show me my balcony events\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0001\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please show me anything to do with Gaspard?\", \"Thank you. On a different note, could you tell me who's invited to the Oren?\", \"I phoned the Taras one — would you mind logging that call, please?\"], [\"anything to do with Gaspard?\", \"diff q, whos invited to the Oren\", \"i phoned the Taras one, log it pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0003\", \"v\": [[\"what's on saturday?\", \"and the 18th?\", \"find the hermit form\", \"any overdue tasks?\", \"just this month\"], [\"umm what have I got on… saturday, what's saturday looking like?\", \"ok and, uh, the 18th?\", \"oh, different thing — can you find the hermit form for me?\", \"hmm, am I… am I behind on any of my tasks? like anything overdue?\", \"ok can you just — just the ones from this month?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0004\", \"v\": [[\"fave photos\"], [\"I want to put a few nice pictures up on the wall and can't decide, so could you show me the photos I've marked as favourites?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0005\", \"v\": [[\"Turns out we're not going ahead with that plan after all, so there's no point keeping it around — could you delete the bacalar pool task for me?\"], [\"can u delete the bacalar pool task pls\"]]}","ttft_ms":13215,"type":"result","duration_ms":30792,"uuid":"6159eeb6-2e2e-4d7b-911e-e6880d65edca","ttft_stream_ms":1404,"time_to_request_ms":163,"first_content_frame_ms":1404,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22181577,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278732207.5557,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
